    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the brake control unit installation in the main gear bay, showing the switch assembly in both sampling interface standards and the pressure transmitter that feeds it.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of the brake control unit installation in the main gear bay, including the switch assembly and the pressure transmitter.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the left main gear bay; the right bay is symmetrically opposite. Items 10 and 10A are the two switch assembly standards. The faster sampling interface at item 10A is required by the current software standard, and loading that software onto an aircraft with item 10 fitted will leave the unit unserviceable. Check the hardware identifier through the maintenance terminal before ordering."
    },
